#!/usr/bin/env bash
cat <<'EOF'

Optional remote desktop (run inside an interactive container shell):
  gui devtunnel
Restart the current/latest GUI tunnel:
  gui devtunnel restart
Or select a tunnel directly:
  devcontainer exec -- gui devtunnel YOUR_TUNNEL_ID

Pick or create a tunnel ID using the arrow-key menu. Saved IDs are not active connections.
Dev Tunnels login and the default ID persist across rebuilds.
Open the printed HTTPS URL and sign in with the same GitHub account.
Stop hosting with Ctrl+C. Nothing starts automatically.

EOF
